        <p>WANTED, COOK-GENERAL; must have good reference, Apply 91, LIVERPoOL-BoaD, Birkdale, Southport.</p>
        <p>WANTED, good GENERAL SERVANT (with character); small family ; and good home,—At once, Bg, DURNING-RolD, Liverpool.</p>
