        <p>PROLIFIC HENS are merely birds in fullvig—ourof health, and the secret of inducing their greatest possible productive powers is to preserve their strength and assist Nature HAMLIN'S POULTRV POWDERS assist nature to sustain the trying strain of wet and changeable weather,: and at the moulting period. Thousands of fowls die at this time simply for the want of a STI U LATI NG RESTORATIVE HELP, such as these Powders afford, Strengthening the Birds, Shortening the Moulting Season, Quickly Invigorating the Growth of Bright New Plumage, and renewing the Fullest Laying Powers, wbriderfully effective in bringing Chicks and Ducklings to a Precocious Maturity, and Starts Pullets Laying. For protection against Chills, Cramp, Capes, or Roup these Powders are invaluable. Mn. Wm. NICLAGAN, East Mid Eamberkin, Perth, writes: "Dear received your three tins of Poultry Powder, and am satisfied with the egg-producing qualities of it. I now beg to enclose postl order for los., in return for which you will send me f, tine of said Powder. We never had so many eggs at this time of the year.</p>
        <p>Your Grocer, Chemist, or Corn Merchant should stock them; if not, send direct to me for sample tin (enough for In fowls for five weeks)l /3, post free; two tins, 2/3; 3 for 3.,-; 6 for 5/6; 12 for 10s.; 20 (to sell again) 165.; all carriage paid. Cash to accompany ALL ORDERS.</p>
