        <head>NESTLE'S 'XMAS PRIZES.</head>
        <p>NESTLE'S 'XMAS PRIZES.</p>
        <p>ONE PRIZE OF TWO ~ ~ FIVE 31 TWENTY-FIVE 1, For the 33 nearest estimates of the number of Tins of NESTLE'S MILK s3ld through the Manchester Office during the year ending December 14th, 1898.</p>
