        <p>INSTRUCTIONS.—Cut off that part of the label of a 'lb. Tin of NESTLE'S MILK across which the words "Prepared in Switzerland" are printed in red (this can be easily (lane by drawing a knife down the black lines enclosiug the part.) On thetack of this write your estimate in figures with your name and address. Nothing else, please, and write clearly. Post this in an enve- ope, penny postage, addressed— 0</p>
