        <p>22, flanging Ditch, Manchester. N.B—The postal authorities will not carry this for a Halfpenny. Employees of the firm not allowed to compete. In cases of ties the Prizes will be divided.</p>
        <p>This Competition is open to residents in Lancashire,Cheshire,and the:towns of Sheffield,Rotherham Chesterfield, Halifax, Huddersfield, and Barnsley. Competitors may send in any number of estimated (one only on each label),but only one prize awarded any one person. Number of tins sold during the same period act year was over Three Millions. The actual number will be advertised in the local papers on December 15th, and the winners names will appear on December 19th.</p>
        <p>Figures certified by Mr. U. H. RUSSELL, Chartered Accountant, 1, Pennel.street, Manchester who will in conjunction with Mr. J. H. THORP, Solicitor, 18, Corporation-street, Manchester, act as Arbitrators, and anyone entering this Competition must accept their decision in any dispute as final.</p>
